Okay, here we go.

883
00:51:15,940 --> 00:51:16,920
There's too much cloth!

884
00:51:21,790 --> 00:51:22,670
Not enough fuel.

885
00:51:24,570 --> 00:51:26,710
There's nothing in these boxes, ever.

886
00:51:34,320 --> 00:51:35,200
Hole there.

887
00:51:38,840 --> 00:51:39,480
This?

888
00:51:41,000 --> 00:51:41,780
Layer?

889
00:51:43,380 --> 00:51:45,060
This was the supply room, right?

890
00:51:45,940 --> 00:51:46,780
Oh no!

891
00:51:46,800 --> 00:51:48,280
I gotta break it open!

892
00:51:49,120 --> 00:51:49,880
No!

893
00:51:55,030 --> 00:51:55,810
Fuel?

894
00:51:56,030 --> 00:51:56,410
That's huge.

895
00:51:58,590 --> 00:51:59,370
Dynamite?

896
00:52:01,030 --> 00:52:01,930
Oh, here we go.

897
00:52:01,990 --> 00:52:02,070
Oh, here we go.

898
00:52:02,070 --> 00:52:02,330
Here we go.

899
00:52:02,910 --> 00:52:03,550
Drop this.

900
00:52:05,010 --> 00:52:05,770
We got it.

901
00:52:09,000 --> 00:52:09,380
Oh!

902
00:52:10,220 --> 00:52:10,600
Nice.

903
00:52:11,840 --> 00:52:12,220
Oh!

904
00:52:12,560 --> 00:52:13,740
There's all kinds of good stuff here.

905
00:52:15,440 --> 00:52:17,700
Damn, I should have left some things at home.

906
00:52:17,880 --> 00:52:18,180
What's this?

907
00:52:18,780 --> 00:52:20,520
Wait a minute, that's not... ammo.

908
00:52:22,000 --> 00:52:23,180
That's a different kind of ammo.

909
00:52:26,900 --> 00:52:28,320
Tell me I can open this now, at least.

910
00:52:29,480 --> 00:52:30,700
Let me make a shortcut here.

911
00:52:33,420 --> 00:52:34,260
There's no way.

912
00:52:45,400 --> 00:52:46,440
I'm wasting time!

913
00:52:49,020 --> 00:52:49,500
No!

914
00:52:50,420 --> 00:52:51,380
No way!

915
00:52:52,640 --> 00:52:56,780
For use when an explosion is necessary, and it will, from time to time, be necessary.

916
00:52:57,000 --> 00:52:58,060
Requires a detonator.

917
00:52:58,180 --> 00:52:58,440
Oh.

918
00:53:02,590 --> 00:53:03,690
What do I not need?

919
00:53:08,080 --> 00:53:08,880
Oh, rough.

920
00:53:09,000 --> 00:53:09,520
This is rough.

921
00:53:11,320 --> 00:53:12,360
Maybe I'll come back here.

922
00:53:13,440 --> 00:53:14,460
Yeah, because...

923
00:53:14,460 --> 00:53:14,700
You know what?

924
00:53:14,700 --> 00:53:15,940
I'm going back now anyway, so...

925
00:53:15,940 --> 00:53:16,620
Here's what I'm gonna do.

926
00:53:16,720 --> 00:53:17,980
I'm gonna blow up this door, and then go.

927
00:53:19,760 --> 00:53:20,720
Wait, we don't have a grenade.

928
00:53:24,590 --> 00:53:25,290
Oh, shit!

929
00:53:25,290 --> 00:53:25,950
We have no grenade.

930
00:53:26,790 --> 00:53:27,150
No!

931
00:53:34,660 --> 00:53:35,020
Nothing.

932
00:53:42,230 --> 00:53:42,830
More fuel!

933
00:53:43,230 --> 00:53:43,830
Oh my god.

934
00:53:44,350 --> 00:53:45,730
Okay, we're gonna leave, um...

935
00:53:46,750 --> 00:53:47,290
This here.

936
00:53:48,230 --> 00:53:49,170
And grab that.

937
00:53:53,210 --> 00:53:54,670
Can I throw something big at it?

938
00:53:55,170 --> 00:53:56,450
Do we have, like, a big stone?

939
00:53:58,890 --> 00:53:59,370
There's a big stone.

940
00:54:03,560 --> 00:54:04,560
Give me a big stone.

941
00:54:04,700 --> 00:54:04,900
Come on.

942
00:54:10,540 --> 00:54:11,500
Can I...

943
00:54:11,500 --> 00:54:12,940
Punch it down with a wrench?

944
00:54:20,440 --> 00:54:21,580
I don't want to wrench it.

945
00:54:21,680 --> 00:54:23,780
I want to smash the door, like a hammer.

946
00:54:25,500 --> 00:54:25,740
No.

947
00:54:26,000 --> 00:54:26,080
Okay.

948
00:54:26,340 --> 00:54:26,820
Shit.

949
00:54:27,020 --> 00:54:27,460
Balls.

950
00:54:28,540 --> 00:54:29,640
I guess we're going back.

951
00:54:43,570 --> 00:54:44,270
Oh god.

952
00:54:46,690 --> 00:54:47,170
Don't...

953
00:54:48,670 --> 00:54:49,930
Don't even think about it.

954
00:54:50,770 --> 00:54:51,050
Oh!

955
00:55:01,980 --> 00:55:02,380
No!

956
00:55:02,680 --> 00:55:03,080
No.

957
00:55:03,280 --> 00:55:04,300
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.

958
00:55:04,520 --> 00:55:05,000
Nope.

959
00:55:06,220 --> 00:55:06,880
Not today.

960
00:55:11,150 --> 00:55:12,250
I think not.

961
00:55:15,240 --> 00:55:16,700
Get the hell out of here.

962
00:55:22,560 --> 00:55:23,580
Okay, I think we're good.

963
00:55:27,840 --> 00:55:28,640
Oh, man.

964
00:55:29,520 --> 00:55:30,240
Okay, quick.

965
00:55:37,050 --> 00:55:38,590
Oh, it's almost empty as well.

966
00:55:38,850 --> 00:55:39,010
No.

967
00:55:43,990 --> 00:55:45,070
Okay, something I've noticed.

968
00:55:46,170 --> 00:55:49,790
When I put in fuel here, it goes from almost empty to here.

969
00:55:51,030 --> 00:55:54,530
Maybe it's not worth it to fill it up again until this one is about to run out.

970
00:55:54,850 --> 00:55:56,010
Let's make shorter trips.

971
00:55:56,790 --> 00:55:59,970
I don't know if I'm right with this theory here, but...

972
00:56:00,650 --> 00:56:01,450
You know what I mean.

973
00:56:03,830 --> 00:56:05,390
Okay, we got the dynamite now.

974
00:56:05,650 --> 00:56:06,510
Let's bring that in here.

975
00:56:09,050 --> 00:56:09,910
Lighter is good.

976
00:56:10,910 --> 00:56:11,310
Wrench.

977
00:56:12,110 --> 00:56:14,530
We bring one of these with us because we got to blow that door open.

978
00:56:16,410 --> 00:56:17,310
All this gas.

979
00:56:17,310 --> 00:56:18,710
I don't know what I should do with that.

980
00:56:24,740 --> 00:56:26,060
Wait, there's a...

981
00:56:34,830 --> 00:56:36,150
There's a hole now!

982
00:56:37,830 --> 00:56:39,290
There was a table there before!

983
00:56:41,310 --> 00:56:41,710
No!

984
00:56:42,890 --> 00:56:43,290
No!

985
00:56:46,270 --> 00:56:46,750
No!

986
00:56:48,790 --> 00:56:49,270
No!

987
00:56:50,750 --> 00:56:51,370
Uh-uh!

988
00:56:53,610 --> 00:56:54,090
Nope!

989
00:56:56,750 --> 00:56:57,670
I hate that!

990
00:57:00,050 --> 00:57:03,550
If the monster comes in here, I may actually die in real life.

991
00:57:09,950 --> 00:57:11,830
I can't do it if that happens.

992
00:57:22,300 --> 00:57:23,280
I changed my mind.

993
00:57:23,360 --> 00:57:24,160
I'm gonna fill this up again.

994
00:57:26,340 --> 00:57:27,860
I just want to see how much I get now.

995
00:57:30,040 --> 00:57:31,400
Yeah, look how little I got!

996
00:57:33,100 --> 00:57:33,820
What the fuck?

997
00:57:35,240 --> 00:57:36,660
Okay, the last one is...

998
00:57:36,660 --> 00:57:38,120
I'm gonna put the last one here.

999
00:57:45,490 --> 00:57:47,050
I swear to god, this monster appears.

1000
00:57:52,150 --> 00:57:53,410
Okay, we got dynamite.

1001
00:57:54,210 --> 00:57:55,370
Now we need a detonator.

1002
00:57:56,910 --> 00:58:00,250
Okay, so Arsenal is no longer active on the map there.

1003
00:58:00,730 --> 00:58:04,010
But I want to go to Supply Closet and get the supplies, I guess.

1004
00:58:05,190 --> 00:58:06,530
We're gonna turn on the generator.

1005
00:58:06,910 --> 00:58:08,370
We're gonna go back to Arsenal.

1006
00:58:09,870 --> 00:58:12,210
Blow open the door to Supply Closet.

1007
00:58:13,830 --> 00:58:15,230
I guess evade them...

1008
00:58:18,330 --> 00:58:19,390
I'm gonna take a break.

1009
00:58:19,610 --> 00:58:20,830
I'll see you guys next time.

1010
00:58:21,010 --> 00:58:21,230
Bye-bye.
